    "image_tabs_zr9wQH": {
      "type": "image-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_7Vt2kL": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Adjustable Weight Changes for Progressive Strength Training",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Precision_Progress_in_a_Compact_Design.webp",
            "text": "<p>Progressive overload is key to building strength at home. Ativafit adjustable dumbbells make it easier to move between lighter and heavier weights for different exercises, so you can train more muscle groups without needing a full rack of fixed dumbbells.</p><ul><li>Switch weights for warm-ups, chest presses, rows, curls, squats, and lunges</li><li>Choose from different Ativafit adjustable dumbbell sets based on your training level</li><li>Support chest workouts, pull day routines, push day training, and full-body strength workouts</li></ul><p>A compact adjustable dumbbell set helps you keep progressing while saving space in your home gym.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_9Qe4mR": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Steel Plate Construction for a More Stable Lift",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/dumbbell_collection_plate.webp",
            "text": "<p>Ativafit adjustable dumbbells are designed to give home workouts a more solid and controlled lifting feel. Compared with bulky plastic alternatives, the steel plate design helps create a more stable experience during strength training.</p><ul><li>Built for controlled movements during presses, rows, curls, and lunges</li><li>Helps reduce the bulky feel often found in oversized plastic dumbbells</li><li>Suitable for home gym users who want a stronger, more reliable dumbbell setup</li></ul><p>This makes Ativafit dumbbells a practical choice for daily strength training at home.</p><h3></h3>"
          }
        },
        "tab_R4p2aN": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Reinforced Base for Safer Home Workouts",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/dumbbell_feature.webp",
            "text": "<p>A stable base matters when you train at home. Ativafit adjustable dumbbells are designed with a reinforced base to help keep the dumbbells secure between sets and make weight changes more convenient.</p><ul><li>Helps keep your adjustable dumbbells organized between exercises</li><li>Supports cleaner storage in apartments, garage gyms, and small workout spaces</li><li>Makes switching between sets easier during fast-paced home workouts</li></ul><p>A more organized setup helps you train with better focus and confidence.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_1dK3s8": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "One Adjustable Dumbbell Set for Different Fitness Levels",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Empower_Every_Family_Member.webp",
            "text": "<p>Ativafit offers adjustable dumbbell options for different users, from beginners to more advanced home strength training. You can choose a lighter set for accessory work or a heavier set for long-term progression.</p><ul><li>Lighter options are ideal for arms, shoulders, and beginner-friendly workouts</li><li>Mid-range sets work well for chest workouts, pull day exercises, and full-body routines</li><li>Heavier adjustable dumbbells support progressive overload and advanced strength goals</li></ul><p>Whether you are starting your home fitness routine or upgrading your home gym, Ativafit adjustable dumbbells help you choose the weight range that fits your goals.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "tab_7Vt2kL",
