        "mention_piwcki": {
          "type": "mention",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The Ativafit Adjustable Dumbbell Set are a space-saving piece of gym equipment that you can incorporate into your strength training routine. These \"dialtech Elites\" are great for both beginners and more advanced lifters who are tight on space. </p>",
